### ================================================================
### FASE 7 — Metas Académicas (AIB-11)
### Prerequisito: fase-1-materias.http ejecutado
###              subjectId=1 "Cálculo Diferencial" existe
###
### Endpoints:
###   PUT  /api/v1/academic/goals          → Crear o actualizar meta
###   GET  /api/v1/academic/goals/{goalId} → Obtener progreso de una meta
###   GET  /api/v1/academic/goals?semester=YYYY-N → Listar progresos del semestre
###
### IDs resultantes al terminar este archivo:
###   goalId=1  "Aprobar Cálculo"    subjectId=1  targetGrade=3.5
###   goalId=2  "Subir el GPA"       subjectId=null  targetGrade=4.0
### ================================================================

@baseUrl = https://aibert-academic-service-qa.yellowwave-cb2d91fc.centralus.azurecontainerapps.io
@studentId = test-student-123
@ct = application/json


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 1 — Error: goalName muy corto (< 3 chars) → 400 Bad Request
# Espera: error de validación @Size
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT meta con nombre de 2 caracteres
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "goalName": "AB",
  "targetGrade": 3.5,
  "subjectId": 1
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 2 — Error: targetGrade fuera de rango (> 5.0) → 400 Bad Request
# Espera: error de validación @DecimalMax
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT meta con targetGrade=6.0
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "goalName": "Meta Invalida",
  "targetGrade": 6.0,
  "subjectId": 1
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 3 — Error: subjectId no existe → 404 Not Found
# Espera: { "success": false, "error": "Materia con id 999 no encontrada", "code": 404 }
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT meta con subjectId=999
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "goalName": "Meta Invalida",
  "targetGrade": 3.5,
  "subjectId": 999
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 4 — Crear meta asociada a materia → 200 OK  (upsert: crea)
# Espera: goalId=1, goalName="Aprobar Cálculo", subjectId=1, targetGrade=3.5
# Sin notas aún → currentAverage=null, requiredGrade=null (o el valor calculado)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT meta "Aprobar Cálculo" vinculada a subjectId=1 — goalId=1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "goalName": "Aprobar Cálculo",
  "targetGrade": 3.5,
  "subjectId": 1
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 5 — Crear meta general (sin materia) → 200 OK  (upsert: crea)
# Espera: goalId=2, goalName="Subir el GPA", subjectId=null, targetGrade=4.0
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT meta "Subir el GPA" sin materia — goalId=2
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "goalName": "Subir el GPA",
  "targetGrade": 4.0
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 6 — Actualizar meta existente (mismo nombre = upsert) → 200 OK
# Sube targetGrade de 3.5 a 4.0 en "Aprobar Cálculo"
# Espera: misma goalId=1, targetGrade=4.0
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT meta "Aprobar Cálculo" actualizada — targetGrade=4.0
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "goalName": "Aprobar Cálculo",
  "targetGrade": 4.0,
  "subjectId": 1
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 7 — Obtener progreso de una meta → 200 OK
# Espera: goalId=1, goalName="Aprobar Cálculo", subjectId=1,
#         targetGrade=4.0, currentAverage, requiredGrade, isAchievable
# Nota: subjectName y semester NO aparecen en la respuesta (eliminados en AIB-11)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET progreso de goalId=1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals/1
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 8 — Error: goalId inexistente → 404 Not Found
# Espera: { "success": false, "error": "...", "code": 404 }
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET progreso de goalId=999
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals/999
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 9 — Listar progresos del semestre → 200 OK
# Espera: lista con metas cuya materia vinculada es del semestre "2025-1"
#         (metas sin materia también pueden aparecer según implementación)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET progresos del semestre 2025-1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals?semester=2025-1
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 10 — Aislamiento: otro estudiante no ve las metas de test-student-123 → 200 OK
# Espera: lista vacía para student-otro
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET progresos de student-otro (sin metas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/goals?semester=2025-1
X-Student-Id: student-otro
